%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: DefaultIntroduction

%rec: Nodes

name: DefaultIntroduction
npc: Welcome to the Terra Vitae headquarters. How can I help you?
#
o_text: I'm looking for a job.
o_goto: LookingForJob
#
o_text: Half your doors have keypads. Am I welcome behind them?
o_id: nova_codes
o_goto: DoorCodes
#
o_text: Nothing, thanks.
o_goto: End

name: LookingForJob
npc: We do have openings. Most of them are for the trials.
#
o_text: Trials?
o_goto: Trials
#
o_text: Anything that doesn't involve being a lab rat?
o_goto: OtherWork
#
o_text: I'll think about it.
o_goto: End

name: Trials
npc: Clinical trials. You sign a waiver, we monitor you for a few weeks, you get paid.
+ Most participants report no lasting effects.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: OtherWork
npc: Courier runs, sometimes. Escort work for the sample transports.
+ Talk to me again when you've done something around here that I can look up.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: End
npc: Terra Vitae thanks you for your visit.
effect: EndConversation

name: DoorCodes
npc: Friends of the earth are welcome everywhere. Offices: 0451. The bar's back rooms: 1996, the year the first wall went up.
+ Don't make me regret it.
effect: SetFlag('knows_tv_codes')
#
o_text: Thank you.
o_id: nova_codes_back
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction
